{"2837930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Warehouse Bots", "steam_appid": 2837930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warehouse Bots is a logistics management game where you build and run automated warehouses. Design rooms and roads, place storage, docks, and equipment, deploy delivery robots, then accept orders and watch goods move through your operation. As traffic builds and equipment wears down, use road signs to restrict turns and filter cargo, configure traffic lights, upgrade your equipment, and expand carefully to remove bottlenecks and keep every delivery moving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROL THE FLOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When robot traffic starts to jam, redesign the road network and take control of every intersection. Restrict specific turns, direct different cargo types with filtering signs, place yield signs, and configure traffic lights to separate competing flows and keep deliveries moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/8b36bedd39ac3521e23fb8aca3d30cc6.poster.avif?t=1787943075\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/8b36bedd39ac3521e23fb8aca3d30cc6.webm?t=1787943075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/8b36bedd39ac3521e23fb8aca3d30cc6.mp4?t=1787943075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configure traffic-light phases to coordinate busy intersections. Control competing traffic flows, reduce waiting times, and prevent heavy robot traffic from locking up your warehouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/9656a1235a5e120f48e1ec46c0158d3a.poster.avif?t=1787943075\" width=1170 height=590 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/9656a1235a5e120f48e1ec46c0158d3a.webm?t=1787943075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/9656a1235a5e120f48e1ec46c0158d3a.mp4?t=1787943075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR WAREHOUSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape each warehouse around the demands of your operation. Build rooms and roads, place truck docks, storage areas, chargers, and equipment, then expand and reorganize the layout as larger orders put it under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/f183ce0548c0d1570fb484e13f928521.poster.avif?t=1787943075\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/f183ce0548c0d1570fb484e13f928521.webm?t=1787943075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/f183ce0548c0d1570fb484e13f928521.mp4?t=1787943075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AUTOMATE EVERY DELIVERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept distribution orders and put your fleet to work. Watch delivery robots unload incoming goods, carry packages to the right storage areas, and bring them back to outgoing docks—then add robots, chargers, and equipment as demand grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/af4cf6a1e9481e055495546712212b3e.poster.avif?t=1787943075\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/af4cf6a1e9481e055495546712212b3e.webm?t=1787943075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/af4cf6a1e9481e055495546712212b3e.mp4?t=1787943075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR ORDERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from distribution orders with different cargo types, quantities, storage requirements, deadlines, and rewards. Make sure you have enough capacity, build specialized storage for frozen, flammable, and chemical goods, and accept only the orders your warehouse is ready to handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/c7b8b2711c8b99c91f8e78327cff0349.avif?t=1787943075\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras_big/c7b8b2711c8b99c91f8e78327cff0349.webp?t=1787943075 width=1560 height=1165 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOLLOW THE CAMPAIGN OR BUILD FREELY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore and expand warehouses throughout a story-driven campaign, with each location introducing new terrain, restrictions, and logistics problems. Or choose a sandbox map and adjust starting money, payouts, storage times, equipment durability, and order limits to create your own logistics challenge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However you play, success depends on understanding the flow, solving bottlenecks, and building a warehouse that can keep up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/e2516e86afc5c7a0dc078202da7725c8.avif?t=1787943075\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras_big/e2516e86afc5c7a0dc078202da7725c8.webp?t=1787943075 width=1560 height=542 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warehouse Bots is a logistics management game where you build and run automated warehouses. Design rooms and roads, place storage, docks, and equipment, deploy delivery robots, then accept orders and watch goods move through your operation. As traffic builds and equipment wears down, use road signs to restrict turns and filter cargo, configure traffic lights, upgrade your equipment, and expand carefully to remove bottlenecks and keep every delivery moving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROL THE FLOW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When robot traffic starts to jam, redesign the road network and take control of every intersection. Restrict specific turns, direct different cargo types with filtering signs, place yield signs, and configure traffic lights to separate competing flows and keep deliveries moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/8b36bedd39ac3521e23fb8aca3d30cc6.poster.avif?t=1787943075\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/8b36bedd39ac3521e23fb8aca3d30cc6.webm?t=1787943075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/8b36bedd39ac3521e23fb8aca3d30cc6.mp4?t=1787943075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configure traffic-light phases to coordinate busy intersections. Control competing traffic flows, reduce waiting times, and prevent heavy robot traffic from locking up your warehouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/9656a1235a5e120f48e1ec46c0158d3a.poster.avif?t=1787943075\" width=1170 height=590 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/9656a1235a5e120f48e1ec46c0158d3a.webm?t=1787943075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/9656a1235a5e120f48e1ec46c0158d3a.mp4?t=1787943075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR WAREHOUSE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape each warehouse around the demands of your operation. Build rooms and roads, place truck docks, storage areas, chargers, and equipment, then expand and reorganize the layout as larger orders put it under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/f183ce0548c0d1570fb484e13f928521.poster.avif?t=1787943075\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/f183ce0548c0d1570fb484e13f928521.webm?t=1787943075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/f183ce0548c0d1570fb484e13f928521.mp4?t=1787943075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AUTOMATE EVERY DELIVERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept distribution orders and put your fleet to work. Watch delivery robots unload incoming goods, carry packages to the right storage areas, and bring them back to outgoing docks—then add robots, chargers, and equipment as demand grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/af4cf6a1e9481e055495546712212b3e.poster.avif?t=1787943075\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/af4cf6a1e9481e055495546712212b3e.webm?t=1787943075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/af4cf6a1e9481e055495546712212b3e.mp4?t=1787943075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR ORDERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from distribution orders with different cargo types, quantities, storage requirements, deadlines, and rewards. Make sure you have enough capacity, build specialized storage for frozen, flammable, and chemical goods, and accept only the orders your warehouse is ready to handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/c7b8b2711c8b99c91f8e78327cff0349.avif?t=1787943075\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras_big/c7b8b2711c8b99c91f8e78327cff0349.webp?t=1787943075 width=1560 height=1165 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOLLOW THE CAMPAIGN OR BUILD FREELY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore and expand warehouses throughout a story-driven campaign, with each location introducing new terrain, restrictions, and logistics problems. Or choose a sandbox map and adjust starting money, payouts, storage times, equipment durability, and order limits to create your own logistics challenge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However you play, success depends on understanding the flow, solving bottlenecks, and building a warehouse that can keep up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras/e2516e86afc5c7a0dc078202da7725c8.avif?t=1787943075\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/extras_big/e2516e86afc5c7a0dc078202da7725c8.webp?t=1787943075 width=1560 height=542 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Take on the role of a warehouse manager overseeing a bustling hub of automated activity. In this immersive simulator, you'll delve into the intricacies of logistics as you control robots, construct efficient road networks, and fine-tune traffic flow to optimize your warehouse operations.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/b747d6b660e36aa5f8dee30db86c89e5c1c0168b/header.jpg?t=1787943075", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/43ed46d35389ca204d05caacd4b63dcf3065ea2d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787943075", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2837930/43ed46d35389ca204d05caacd4b63dcf3065ea2d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787943075", "website": "http://shortstorygames.eu", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1024 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 3D capable<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1024 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2048 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon rx480<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1024 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>